stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: PlaceOrder (COD)
    
    Pending --> Confirmed: Admin/System Confirm
    Pending --> Cancelled: Buyer/System Cancel (Hold Released)
    
    Confirmed --> Processing: Start Fulfillment
    Processing --> Shipped: Handover to Logistics
    
    Shipped --> Delivered: OTP Verified & GPS Validated
    Shipped --> Refused: Buyer Refuses (Commitment Captured)
    Shipped --> Failed: Delivery Retries Exhausted
    
    Delivered --> WaitingForDispute: 24h Window Starts
    
    WaitingForDispute --> Settled: Window Expired (Payouts Triggered)
    WaitingForDispute --> Disputed: Buyer Raises Dispute (Funds Frozen)
    
    Disputed --> Settled: Dispute Resolved (Manual Payout)
    Disputed --> Refunded: Dispute Resolved (Refund to Buyer)
    
    Settled --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]
    Refused --> [*]
    Refunded --> [*]
